index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..6e11a25144ebd62c2e0b61e212667d93e06ba0a0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/xbe/vm-query-fastpath/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+# VM query boundary and work oracle
+
+Build with `NXDK_DIR=/path/to/nxdk make`. The 994 checks use only public APIs
+and owned fixed-address reservations. All seven MEMORY_BASIC_INFORMATION fields
+are asserted against captured public reference records, including sparse/mixed/noaccess and free-region boundaries and
+invalid high-address output preservation. No arbitrary output pointers or
+private page tables are read. Timings are diagnostic batch counter deltas;
+correctness acceptance never relies on timing. The synthetic 256-fragment
+workload is not a recorded game allocation layout.
+
+The original 989 checks include 145 complete captured MBI/status oracle cases.
+The five additional main compatibility checks exercise main's currently accepted
+reserve-only wrapped high tail and verify the earlier valid low reservation's
+status, complete MBI and output guards. They are separate from the captured
+reference oracle. The high reservation is never committed or released and stays
+owned until this isolated fixture exits; only the valid low range is released.
